  "steps": [
    "Granola: heat the oven to 160 °C. Mix the oats, coffee grounds, cocoa and nuts, then the tahini and syrup until coated.",
    "Spread on a lined sheet and bake 20–25 minutes, stirring once, until golden. Cool completely, then stir in the chocolate. Keeps 2 weeks airtight.",
    "Cold brew: stir the water and coffee grounds in a jar and refrigerate 12–18 hours, then strain.",
    "Blend the banana, almond milk, vanilla and ice. Fill a glass halfway with ice and cold brew, then gently pour the smoothie on top and dust with cinnamon."
